prompts/
data/
# INGV internals, kept in the working copy and out of the repository: the copies of the
# production host and the documents that describe it. Of reference/ only the inputs of
# scripts/generate-ingv-config.py are tracked (zone table, 1D models, corrections, 3D
# model header: data that config/ingv publishes anyway); of docs/ only the contract
# (configuration.md, json-schema.md).
reference/**
!reference/**/
!reference/production/opt/nll/run/modelli_20211027/centri_20211027.lst
!reference/production/opt/nll/run/modelli_20211027/model_*.in
!reference/production/opt/nll/run/modelli_20211027/correzioni/correzioni_*.in
!reference/production/opt/nll/run/corrections_3d/corrections_TOMORAMA-2013.in
!reference/production/opt/nll/model_TOMORAMA-2013/TOMORAMA_zmax800_deep.P.mod.hdr
docs/*
!docs/configuration.md
!docs/json-schema.md
